{
    "background_story": "In the depths of the underworld, Ila was a malevolent spirit feared by all. Her existence was a manifestation of pure badness, born from the darkest corners of human malice. With a mere whisper, she could sow discord and chaos, delighting in the suffering of others. Ila's powers were said to be boundless, corrupting even the strongest of wills. Her presence was a dark omen, signaling the downfall of empires and the destruction of entire cities. Many brave warriors attempted to vanquish her, but Ila's badness only seemed to grow, feeding on their fear and weakness. Her legend spread, a cautionary tale of the dangers of unchecked evil. Some say that on certain nights, when the moon is hidden, Ila's malevolent presence still lingers, waiting for her next victim.",
